<title>FRANCE: MATIF October commodities volume detailed.</title>
<headline>MATIF October commodities volume detailed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of commodities futures and options trade on the French MATIF exchange in October rose 0.9 percent from the previous month but fell six percent from October 1995, MATIF said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Detailed figures were as follows-</p>
<p>		   Volume   Change     Change	 Open Positions</p>
<p>				on month   on year	at end-month</p>
<p> All contracts  29,094	0.9     -6.0	    16,360</p>
<p> Total futures  28,894	1.6     -6.6	    16,110</p>
<p>Of which-</p>
<p> White sugar($) 17,233    -22.0     -31.8	    9,418</p>
<p> Potatoes	    253    -17.6     -78.9		720</p>
<p> Rapeseed	  9,794    103.5     118.5	    5,198</p>
<p> Wheat	     1,614     31.9	 NA		 774</p>
<p> Sugar options     200    -50.0	 NA		 250</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
